eates positive atmosphere, reliable, decision quality, but communication difficulty may be fatal. I'd lean toward Candidate B? Let's argue.\n\nWe need to start discussion, propose a candidate, give evidence. Let's vote Candidate B.\n\nWrite public message: propose Candidate B, reference strengths and concerns, compare with others.\n\nProceed."}
